Enterprise IT Ticketing, Zammad Deployment & Automated Analytics Pipeline
A production-ready, highly customized IT support helpdesk and reporting system built on Ubuntu Server, containerized via Docker, powered by Zammad, and augmented with custom Python/Pandas data pipelines.

🏗️ System Architecture & Tech Stack
OS: Ubuntu Server 26.04.1 LTS

Containerization: Docker & Docker Compose V2

Helpdesk Core: Zammad (PostgreSQL backend)

Front-End UI: HTML5, CSS3 (Custom DHC Theme), jQuery (MutationObserver)

Reporting Engine: Python, Pandas, Openpyxl, Pillow (PIL)

Automation & Transfer: Bash scripting, Cron, SCP, SSH

⚙️ Phase 1: Server Setup & Dockerized Zammad Deployment

Update System Packages:

Bash
sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y


Install Docker and Compose:

Bash
sudo apt install docker.io docker-compose-v2 -y


Clone and Configure Zammad Docker Environment:

Bash
git clone https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose.git
cd zammad-docker-compose


Tune Kernel Parameters (Required for Elasticsearch/Zammad stability):

Bash
sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144



Deploy the Containers:

Bash
sudo docker compose up -d





